{
  "bio": [
    "Sujit Bhayani is managing director of Vadodara-based specialty chemicals company Sudeep Pharma.",
    "The company makes calcium, zinc, iron, and magnesium salts, which are used in pills and capsules for binding and filling.",
    "He founded Sudeep Pharma in 1989 as a maker of calcium carbonate for the pharma industry.",
    "Sudeep has five factories, four in Gujarat and one in southern Ireland.",
    "The company was listed in November 2025 and raised $100 million in its IPO."
  ],
  "about": [
    "His son Shanil, who studied business at Drexel University, is a director on the company's board.",
    "Sujit has an undergrad degree in chemistry from the University of Tulsa",
    "Sudeep Pharma's subsidiary, Sudeep Advanced Materials, makes chemicals for EV batteries."
  ]
}